{"seq":4,"slug":"release-management","title":"版本发布管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/release-management","wordCount":748,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本发布管理\">版本发布管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>版本发布管理把&quot;什么时候、以什么含义发布新版本&quot;变成可预测的流程。它建立在几个核心约定之上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义化版本（SemVer）</td>\n<td>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH，分别对应破坏性、功能、修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Changesets</td>\n<td>每个 PR 附带变更描述，自动汇总版本与 CHANGELOG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动化发布流水线</td>\n<td>用 CI 完成版本号更新、发布与 Release 创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dist-tag</td>\n<td>区分稳定版（latest）与预览版（next/alpha）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破坏性变更管理</td>\n<td>提供迁移指南与 Codemod，降低 MAJOR 升级成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语义化版本控制\">语义化版本控制</h2><p>语义化版本（Semantic Versioning, SemVer）是开源社区广泛采用的版本编号约定。版本号格式为 <code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>，每个部分有明确的递增规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    V[版本号] --&gt; MAJOR[MAJOR&lt;br/&gt;不兼容变更]&#10;    V --&gt; MINOR[MINOR&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容新功能]&#10;    V --&gt; PATCH[PATCH&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容修复]&#10;    MAJOR --&gt; EXAMPLE1[2.0.0]&#10;    MINOR --&gt; EXAMPLE2[1.3.0]&#10;    PATCH --&gt; EXAMPLE3[1.2.4]\">graph LR\n    V[版本号] --&gt; MAJOR[MAJOR&lt;br/&gt;不兼容变更]\n    V --&gt; MINOR[MINOR&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容新功能]\n    V --&gt; PATCH[PATCH&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容修复]\n    MAJOR --&gt; EXAMPLE1[2.0.0]\n    MINOR --&gt; EXAMPLE2[1.3.0]\n    PATCH --&gt; EXAMPLE3[1.2.4]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本变更</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>用户影响</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAJOR</td>\n<td>移除 API、改变行为</td>\n<td>需要修改代码</td>\n<td>1.x → 2.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MINOR</td>\n<td>新增功能、新增 API</td>\n<td>无需修改，可选择使用</td>\n<td>1.2.x → 1.3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATCH</td>\n<td>Bug 修复、安全补丁</td>\n<td>无需修改，建议立即更新</td>\n<td>1.2.3 → 1.2.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pre-release</td>\n<td>测试版本</td>\n<td>不保证稳定性</td>\n<td>2.0.0-alpha.1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm version patch -m &quot;chore: release %s&quot;&#10;&#10;npm version minor -m &quot;chore: release %s&quot;&#10;&#10;npm version major -m &quot;chore: release %s&quot;&#10;&#10;npm version prerelease --preid=alpha\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> patch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: release %s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> minor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: release %s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> major</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: release %s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prerelease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preid=alpha</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 <code>1.0.0</code> 之前（即 <code>0.x.y</code> 阶段），API 被视为不稳定。此阶段 MINOR 版本变更也可能包含不兼容修改。尽早发布 <code>1.0.0</code> 向用户传达稳定性承诺。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-工作流\">Changesets 工作流</h2><p>Changesets 是一种现代化的版本管理方式，特别适合 Monorepo 项目。每次 PR 附带一个描述变更的 changeset 文件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx changeset init&#10;&#10;npx changeset add&#10;&#10;npx changeset version&#10;&#10;npx changeset publish\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个 changeset 文件的内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;my-awesome-lib&#39;: minor&#10;---&#10;&#10;新增暗色模式支持，通过 `useTheme` Hook 可在运行时切换主题。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-awesome-lib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">新增暗色模式支持，通过 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`useTheme`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Hook 可在运行时切换主题。</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant D as 开发者&#10;    participant PR as Pull Request&#10;    participant BOT as Changeset Bot&#10;    participant CI as Release CI&#10;&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;PR: 提交代码 + changeset 文件&#10;    BOT-&gt;&gt;PR: 检查是否包含 changeset&#10;    PR-&gt;&gt;PR: 合并到 main&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: changeset version&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 生成 CHANGELOG&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 更新版本号&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: changeset publish&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 创建 GitHub Release\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant D as 开发者\n    participant PR as Pull Request\n    participant BOT as Changeset Bot\n    participant CI as Release CI\n\n    D-&gt;&gt;PR: 提交代码 + changeset 文件\n    BOT-&gt;&gt;PR: 检查是否包含 changeset\n    PR-&gt;&gt;PR: 合并到 main\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: changeset version\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 生成 CHANGELOG\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 更新版本号\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: changeset publish\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 创建 GitHub Release</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加变更描述</td>\n<td><code>changeset add</code></td>\n<td>创建 changeset 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇总版本</td>\n<td><code>changeset version</code></td>\n<td>更新版本号和 CHANGELOG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布</td>\n<td><code>changeset publish</code></td>\n<td>发布到 npm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态检查</td>\n<td><code>changeset status</code></td>\n<td>查看待发布变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动化发布流水线\">自动化发布流水线</h2><p>将发布过程完全自动化，减少人为失误并提高发布频率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: write&#10;  packages: write&#10;  pull-requests: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          registry-url: https://registry.npmjs.org&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm build&#10;      - run: pnpm test&#10;      - uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          publish: pnpm changeset publish&#10;          version: pnpm changeset version&#10;          commit: &#39;chore: version packages&#39;&#10;          title: &#39;chore: version packages&#39;&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull-requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry-url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://registry.npmjs.org</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets/action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore: version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm pack --dry-run&#10;&#10;npm publish --dry-run&#10;&#10;npm publish --access public&#10;&#10;npm dist-tag add my-awesome-lib@2.0.0-beta.1 next\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --access</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> public</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist-tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-awesome-lib@2.0.0-beta.1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> next</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-release-与分发\">GitHub Release 与分发</h2><p>GitHub Release 是向用户传达版本信息和分发预编译产物的标准方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"gh release create v1.2.0 \\&#10;  --title &quot;v1.2.0&quot; \\&#10;  --notes-file CHANGELOG.md \\&#10;  --generate-notes&#10;&#10;gh release create v2.0.0-alpha.1 \\&#10;  --title &quot;v2.0.0 Alpha 1&quot; \\&#10;  --prerelease \\&#10;  --notes &quot;首个 v2 预览版，请谨慎用于生产环境。&quot;&#10;&#10;gh release upload v1.2.0 dist/*.tar.gz\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.2.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"v1.2.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --notes-file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CHANGELOG.md</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --generate-notes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.0.0-alpha.1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --title</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"v2.0.0 Alpha 1\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --prerelease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --notes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"首个 v2 预览版，请谨慎用于生产环境。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upload</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.2.0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.tar.gz</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TAG[Git Tag] --&gt; RELEASE[GitHub Release]&#10;    RELEASE --&gt; NOTES[Release Notes]&#10;    RELEASE --&gt; ASSETS[预编译产物]&#10;    RELEASE --&gt; NPM[npm 发布]&#10;    NOTES --&gt; AUTO[自动生成]&#10;    NOTES --&gt; MANUAL[手动编写]&#10;    ASSETS --&gt; BIN[二进制文件]&#10;    ASSETS --&gt; ARCHIVE[源码归档]\">graph TD\n    TAG[Git Tag] --&gt; RELEASE[GitHub Release]\n    RELEASE --&gt; NOTES[Release Notes]\n    RELEASE --&gt; ASSETS[预编译产物]\n    RELEASE --&gt; NPM[npm 发布]\n    NOTES --&gt; AUTO[自动生成]\n    NOTES --&gt; MANUAL[手动编写]\n    ASSETS --&gt; BIN[二进制文件]\n    ASSETS --&gt; ARCHIVE[源码归档]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分发渠道</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>工具/平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>npm</td>\n<td>Node.js 包</td>\n<td>npm publish</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PyPI</td>\n<td>Python 包</td>\n<td>twine upload</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>crates.io</td>\n<td>Rust 包</td>\n<td>cargo publish</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Release</td>\n<td>预编译二进制</td>\n<td>gh release</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker Hub</td>\n<td>容器镜像</td>\n<td>docker push</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homebrew</td>\n<td>macOS CLI 工具</td>\n<td>brew tap</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 为每个发布版本设置 <code>dist-tag</code>。稳定版使用 <code>latest</code>（默认），预览版使用 <code>next</code> 或 <code>alpha</code>，确保 <code>npm install</code> 默认安装稳定版。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"破坏性变更管理\">破坏性变更管理</h2><p>MAJOR 版本升级需要特别谨慎的变更管理策略，帮助用户平滑迁移。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# 从 v1 迁移到 v2&#10;&#10;## 破坏性变更&#10;&#10;### `createApp` API 签名变更&#10;&#10;**v1:** createApp(options)&#10;&#10;**v2:** createApp(root, options)&#10;&#10;### 移除的功能&#10;&#10;| 已移除功能     | 替代方案            |&#10;| -------------- | ------------------- |&#10;| legacyMode     | 使用 compatMode     |&#10;| renderToString | 使用 renderToStream |&#10;&#10;## 自动迁移工具&#10;&#10;运行 codemod 自动完成大部分迁移：&#10;&#10;npx @mylib/codemod v2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># 从 v1 迁移到 v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 破坏性变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`createApp`</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> API 签名变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**v1:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> createApp(options)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**v2:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> createApp(root, options)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 移除的功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 已移除功能     | 替代方案            |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| -------------- | ------------------- |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| legacyMode     | 使用 compatMode     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| renderToString | 使用 renderToStream |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 自动迁移工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">运行 codemod 自动完成大部分迁移：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">npx @mylib/codemod v2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx @mylib/codemod v2 --dry-run&#10;&#10;npx @mylib/codemod v2 --path=src/&#10;&#10;git diff --stat\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @mylib/codemod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @mylib/codemod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path=src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stat</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((版本发布管理))&#10;    SemVer&#10;      MAJOR&#10;      MINOR&#10;      PATCH&#10;      Pre-release&#10;    Changesets&#10;      changeset add&#10;      changeset version&#10;      changeset publish&#10;    自动化&#10;      GitHub Actions&#10;      npm publish&#10;      GitHub Release&#10;    分发&#10;      npm&#10;      GitHub Release&#10;      Docker Hub&#10;    迁移&#10;      迁移指南&#10;      Codemod 工具&#10;      dist-tag 管理\">mindmap\n  root((版本发布管理))\n    SemVer\n      MAJOR\n      MINOR\n      PATCH\n      Pre-release\n    Changesets\n      changeset add\n      changeset version\n      changeset publish\n    自动化\n      GitHub Actions\n      npm publish\n      GitHub Release\n    分发\n      npm\n      GitHub Release\n      Docker Hub\n    迁移\n      迁移指南\n      Codemod 工具\n      dist-tag 管理</pre><ul>\n<li>语义化版本（SemVer）是开源社区的版本编号标准，MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH 各有明确含义。</li>\n<li>Changesets 工作流让每个 PR 附带变更描述，自动汇总生成 CHANGELOG 和版本号。</li>\n<li>自动化发布流水线（GitHub Actions + Changesets）减少人为失误，提高发布频率。</li>\n<li>GitHub Release 用于分发预编译产物和传达版本信息，配合 dist-tag 管理预览版。</li>\n<li>MAJOR 版本升级应提供详细迁移指南和自动化 Codemod 工具，帮助用户平滑过渡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本发布管理","id":"版本发布管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化版本控制","id":"语义化版本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets 工作流","id":"changesets-工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化发布流水线","id":"自动化发布流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Release 与分发","id":"github-release-与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"破坏性变更管理","id":"破坏性变更管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开源项目的 CI/CD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/ci-cd-for-oss"},"next":{"title":"贡献者体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/community-growth/contributor-experience"}}